# Model sources that are not Claude accounts (claude-acct). One per line:
#   name kind ref [reserve=N] [max_live=N] [parent=name] [alert=off] [priority=must|low]
# Kinds: codex (ref: the Codex sessions dir), litellm-key (ref: the key file; its budget from the
# gateway), litellm-team (ref: a member key file; the team's budget). reserve is the last percent of
# the window kept for the human (pace.conf RESERVE_PCT when absent), max_live caps the running queue
# items on the source, parent names the pool a key spends inside: it has room only when the pool does.
# alert=off: `check pace` (the source-pace watch) never calls the source over pace, though an unread one
# still trips; dispatch keeps to its room either way. priority is the consumer class the source serves,
# for a source the gateway does not label (a gateway team or key carries its own metadata.priority): the
# Costs tab's Consumers calls a priority-must consumer on a priority=low source a MISMATCH.
# Priority split (2026-11-10): `codex` (dispatch sessions) keeps 30% of the Codex plan back, and
# `codex-core` reads the same rollouts with reserve=5, so priority-must headless work (agentctl-run
# SOURCE=codex-core) runs on to 95%. Only codex-core alerts: codex inside its 30% is priority-must
# work spending as intended, not a red. `core` is the gateway team lazer-core (priority must: home
# services, comms, knowledge-engine, lazer-eval); `lazer` is lazer-pool (priority low: cl --lazer and
# the rest). Gateway teams and key priorities: home-config apps/litellm/README.md.
# The Claude accounts are in `accounts`; each source is in exactly one of the two. harnesses.json
# ties a harness to its source with `source`. Edited by hand; claude-acct is the only reader.
codex      codex         ~/.codex/sessions                        reserve=30 max_live=6 alert=off priority=low
codex-core codex         ~/.codex/sessions                        reserve=5 priority=must
core       litellm-team  ~/.local/state/agentctl/lazer-eval.key   reserve=10 alert=off
lazer      litellm-team  ~/.local/state/opencode/litellm-paid.key reserve=20 alert=off
reserve    litellm-key   ~/.local/state/claude-lazer/key          max_live=2 parent=lazer reserve=15 alert=off
eval       litellm-key   ~/.local/state/agentctl/lazer-eval.key   parent=core reserve=15 alert=off
